{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>As a lost soul, survive the endless nightmare of the festival.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The summer festival in the animal village comes to an end, and night falls.<br>As it has been for over a hundred years, the villagers gather beneath the great tree to give thanks to the spirit. But this time, something is different. The chosen representative suddenly changes, consumed by madness, and begins hunting down the other animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a mysterious soul, possessing one of the animals at the festival.<br>You have no memory, no reason for being here\u2014but you know there is something you must discover. Alongside the other animals, you must flee, hide, and explore, uncovering the truth buried within this tragic night that endlessly repeats itself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3D First-Person Open World</strong>: Explore the village and its outskirts\u2014including the graveyard, forest, and construction site\u2014to uncover hidden secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Game of Tag</strong>: Experience the tense thrill of being hunted by the representative, where survival is never guaranteed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles and Exploration</strong>: Collect fragments of forgotten memories and unravel the mystery of ancient traditions and history.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Looping Structure</strong>: The night repeats over and over again. Only you can reconnect the broken chain of memory.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you end the curse of the festival?<br>Or will you wander forever in the depths of oblivion?</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Ah\u2026 My Secret Place","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3999290/82d635c19306efd4cf28f3f71d22cb10f3c4f02a.jpg"},{"name"